Z||000000||fierobaby||08-19-2001||12:55 PM||||ok so I hit the gas peddle but the thing is I have to push the peddle down about 2 inches before the car will even think of going faster... is this with all Fieros? if not can it be fixed easily? or do I just have to get used to it?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Mach10||08-19-2001||01:12 PM||||Does it feel loose? Might be a slack cable. Have someone watch your throttle while you move the pedal. If it doesn't move, you'd have to take up the slack. Otherwise, I'd suspect an internal problem, most likely with the FI system. Bad TPS p'raps?||||reg||6
