Z||000005||theogre||08-19-2001||03:54 PM||||The back of the plastic part is on a pivot and has a spring to keep it vertical.<P>Pushing the top of the pedal will make the plastic part tilt on the metal arm.<P>There are a couple reasons for this but the main one is so that the plastic part will rotate as you push the arm down. It keeps the pedal from tilting under your foot and prevents breakage of the plastic part when you floor it.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 08-19-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000006||AL||08-19-2001||04:21 PM||||it might be that your throtle is dirty,take off the air hose and spray some carb cleaner in the throtle body, open it up and shoot it all around inside,also clean the spring lever where the wire is attached too it might be dirty also.<B>AL</B> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/AL_sig.gif"> <BR>84 iNDY (STOLE IT)250$<BR>86GT rebuilt it<BR>89 ws6 GTA89<P>------------------<BR> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||Joe Torma||08-19-2001||05:32 PM||||You must have a 4 banger...evey duke I've driven has rotten throttle response.  Its the Throttle body Injection.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"> Oh, better be careful....I'm not downin' the duke...They are pretty quick after that dead spot!<P>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 08-19-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 08-19-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000008||stsmithgt||08-20-2001||09:54 AM||||I have a V6.  I let a buddy drive it.(very nervous).  He is about 6' tall and had the same problem of pushing the pedal a long ways before it would respond.  That's what happens when you push at the top of the pedal.  My buddy had boots on.  When I noticed that, I told him to drive it bear foot to fit the pedals better and to push at the pivot point or lower on the pedal.  That solved the technique problem.  <P>DON'T SWEAT THE PETTY STUFF..PET THE.....oh never mind. I'm just happy my GT is back on the road after three weeks and it's awsome again!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Cheers to Cliff's Fiero Family forum.<P>------------------<BR>My work of art.(in progress.)    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/carpicsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
